# Voice layer — a spoken clip over a sampled beat. The announcement plays unwarped (as recorded,
# not stretched to the grid or moved to the chords), cued on beat 3 of bar 1. Then the same voice
# is chopped at its phrases and sequenced like a sampler's pads ("Chopped. Looped."), and its last
# line comes back at 1.5× speed, pitched up like a record played fast. The beat and horns sit on
# a `music` bus that ducks under the voice (sidechain compression, the radio DJ's move); the break
# gets SP-1200-style grit, the horns a little tape drive.
# The voice was made with macOS `say` (see design/voice-layer notes in design/mixer.md).
tempo 88
key F mixolydian
samples ../samples

clip brk    = marine-band/stems/Thunderer/drums.wav      slice loop-1  warp beats
clip horns  = marine-band/stems/Thunderer/other.wav      slice loop-2
clip voice  = voice/announcer.wav  warp off
clip quick  = voice/announcer.wav  warp off  speed 1.5x

kit b     = chop brk by beats 0.5
kit h     = chop horns by beats 1
kit words = chop voice by phrases      # 1 "Ladies and gentlemen." … 4 "Chopped." 5 "Looped." …
kit fast  = chop quick by phrases

chords I7 . IV7 . | I7 . V7 IV7
chords I7 . IV7 . | I7 . V7 IV7

track b        steps "1 _ 2 _ 3 _ 3 4 | 5 _ 6 _ 7 8 7 _"   swing 58  transpose 0  out music
  lofi  12bit  26k
  comp  6:1  -24dB  attack 3ms  release 80ms  makeup 6dB
track h        steps "1 . . 3 . . 2 . | . . 4 . 3 . . ."   swing 58  follow  filter hp 250  bars 9-16  out music
  drive  8dB  tone 7k
  pan   25
  send  room 25%

# The whole announcement, as recorded.
track voice    at 1:3
  noisegate  -50dB
  send  room 12%

# Vocal chops: "Chopped." "Looped." on the beat, then "And played again."
track words    steps "4 . 5 . | 4 . 5 . | 6 _ _ _ | . . . ." grid 4  bars 9-12
  send  room 20%
track words.4  as stutter  at 13  stutter 4
track fast.8   at 15

# The music ducks under the announcement and under the vocal chops.
bus music
  comp  3:1  -20dB  attack 5ms  release 300ms  sidechain voice
  comp  3:1  -20dB  attack 5ms  release 200ms  sidechain words

bus room
  reverb  plate  1.4s  predelay 15ms  damp 40%
  width   140%

master
  loudness -14LUFS
